 "sentences": [
  "In the 1590s, workers dug right through Pompeii and didn't realize it.",
  "Architect Domenico Fontana was building a water channel from the Sarno River.",
  "His tunnel ran underneath the buried city.",
  "Workers even found inscriptions, but nobody followed up.",
  "Real excavations began in 1748, and at first the site was thought to be Stabiae.",
  "Only in 1763 did an inscription confirm the city was Pompeii.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
